unit: dm-vocab-bypass-core
commits: d36220870 (the conversion)
what: sovereign/crates/sovereign-core/src/runtime/evidence_loop/anchoring.rs
  cached_atoms now parses atoms.json through
  corpus_engine_vocab::read::read_atlas_atoms, the door dm-vocab-door-move
  moved to the vocab leaf, replacing its own serde_json::from_str::<AtomsFile>.
  The atlas directory is built with the leaf's read::ATLAS_DIRNAME constant
  (dm-vocab-atlas-dirname). Behaviour unchanged: mtime-keyed cache, best-effort
  None on missing/garbled atlas, borrow-in-place over file.atoms.
  The row's premise held: the only atoms.json parse in the crate is that one
  site (grep -n 'from_str::<AtomsFile>' -> the line converted).
